# Popup shell

Extension popup only (`html.md-popup`). Options page is out of scope.

## Fixed size (all views)

Lock size via theme tokens in `src/styles/theme.css` — never per-screen:

| Token | Value | Meaning |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `--spacing-popup` | `30rem` (480px) | Width |
| `--spacing-popup-h` | `37.5rem` (600px) | Height |
| `--spacing-pad` | `1.25rem` | Default padding |

```ts
// ❌ BAD — screen-specific popup size
<main className="h-[520px] w-[420px]">

// ✅ GOOD — fill the locked shell
<main className="box-border flex h-full w-full flex-col overflow-hidden …">
```

Loading, welcome, persona, and home/focus must share the same width and height.

## Scroll

- Root (`html.md-popup` / `body` / `#root`) stays `overflow: hidden` — no page scroll.
- Brand header and bottom nav stay fixed; they must not scroll away.
- Prefer fitting static screens in the frame. Do not add scroll to “make room.”
- Scroll only unbounded lists (e.g. Focus Settings allowlist) with `overflow-y-auto` + `.md-scroll`.

## Scrollbar (`.md-scroll`)

Ultra-thin and quiet (~4px). Transparent track; soft muted thumb; slightly clearer on hover. Firefox: `scrollbar-width: thin` + matching `scrollbar-color`. Do not force a visible gutter unless layout jumps.

## Anti-clutter

After narrowing, fix clipping with spacing/typography only. Do not add cards, denser chrome, pill clusters, or fill space for its own sake.

Spec: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-07-popup-shell-design.md`
